\b\fs24 TaskFlow\b0\fs20\par
\i A high-performance task manager and AI prompt assistant for Windows.\i0\par
Developed by s4nby. Released under the MIT License.\par
\par

\b\fs22 ABOUT THIS APPLICATION\b0\fs20\par
\pard TaskFlow is a minimalist desktop productivity application that combines a to-do list manager with AI-powered prompt capabilities. It runs entirely on your local machine and is designed for speed, privacy, and reliability.\par
\par

\b\fs22 INSTALLATION\b0\fs20\par
By proceeding, you agree to install TaskFlow on this computer. The application will be installed in Program Files, and shortcuts will be created on your Desktop and in the Start Menu. Administrator privileges are required to complete the installation.\par
\par

\b\fs22 PRIVACY POLICY\b0\fs20\par

\b Local Data\b0\par
All your tasks, notes, and application settings are stored locally on your device. TaskFlow does not operate any servers and does not transmit your personal data or task content to any third party.\par
\par

\b AI Features\b0\par
TaskFlow optionally connects to third-party AI services to power its prompt assistant features. These connections are made directly from your device using API keys that you configure. The following services may be used:\par
\pard\li360\bullet  Groq (api.groq.com)\par
\bullet  Google Gemini API\par
\pard Requests sent to these services are subject to their respective privacy policies. TaskFlow does not store, log, or forward your prompts or AI responses.\par
\par

\b Automatic Updates\b0\par
TaskFlow periodically checks for new versions by querying GitHub Releases (api.github.com). This request includes your current application version and is subject to GitHub\'92s privacy policy. No personally identifiable information is transmitted.\par
\par

\b No Telemetry\b0\par
TaskFlow does not collect analytics, crash reports, diagnostics, or usage statistics of any kind.\par
\par

\b\fs22 DISCLAIMER\b0\fs20\par
TaskFlow is provided {\i as is}, without warranty of any kind, express or implied. The author shall not be liable for any damages, loss of data, or other harm arising from the use or inability to use this application.\par
\par

